# Morphine EC50 LoF, expression-corrected (side view)
close session
open /Users/mkh/GitHub/mor_dms_analysis/structures/raw/experimental/8ef6.cif
delete ~/R
delete :CLR
delete solvent
hide atoms
show /R cartoons
color /R #cccccc
show :MOI atoms
